false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-01T11:17:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T11:18:14Z","closed_at":"2026-02-01T11:17:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115709","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115709.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115709.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"…reservation\r\n\r\nAdd a new \"Anime\" tonemapping mode optimized for stylized/anime-style rendering. The tonemapper works in luminance space to preserve color saturation through highlight compression, includes a selective vibrancy boost for vivid colors, and applies a subtle S-curve contrast enhancement. This addresses the common issue where standard tonemappers (ACES, Filmic) desaturate bright colors, which is undesirable for anime/cel-shaded visual styles.\r\n\r\nEnhance DIFFUSE_TOON with multi-band stepping for cleaner light/shadow boundaries with a subtle mid-tone gradient band. Enhance SPECULAR_TOON with tighter smoothstep transitions for sharper specular highlights and a secondary highlight band for hair/eye specular common in anime rendering.\r\n\r\nImprove bloom color preservation in the Screen glow blend mode by adding a subtle hue-preserving re-saturation step that counteracts the natural desaturation from Gaussian blur during bloom generation.\r\n\r\nAll changes are implemented across RD (desktop + mobile) and GLES3 compatibility renderers with full documentation.\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DqLMpVV64cCGyEaMz5tpfw\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"iwannabealive","id":91596111,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXWlTw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91596111?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive","html_url":"https://github.com/iwannabealive","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iwannabealive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115709/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":5,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115709/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}